stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Requested
    Requested --> Rejected: Invalid recipe, ingredients or queue capacity / consume nothing
    Requested --> Queued: Valid request / consume inputs exactly once
    Queued --> Running: Processing slot available
    Running --> Running: Save and restore remaining progress under approved policy
    Running --> CompletedHolding: Required duration completed / retain output
    CompletedHolding --> Delivered: Valid durable delivery / award output once
    Delivered --> Delivered: Duplicate delivery request / no additional output
    Rejected --> [*]
    Delivered --> [*]
